The current task involves analyzing a set of completed trials for a deep neural network model applied to molecular property prediction. The basic idea is to utilize a comparative analysis of deep learning models to predict molecular properties relevant to drug discovery. The model used is a deep neural network (Chagas EP20), and the objective is to optimize its performance using hyperparameter tuning via grid search or Hyperopt.

